      "en": "and they will spring up among the grass, as willows by the watercourses.",
      "ko": "그들이 풀 가운데서 솟아나기를 시냇가의 버들 같이 할 것이라",
      "source_text_hash": "3353e9e5328e6c91aef383954090a30978fb320ba58e2a85e22ce7e867d45ea7",
      "translation_text_hash": "ce4db7010083ef8d39c8edd9ca21fa33a6e446a7c1ea397b73878d71a43f4817",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
