        }
      ],
      "en": "Who has fashioned a god, or molds an image that is profitable for nothing?",
      "ko": "신상을 만들며 무익한 우상을 부어 만든 자가 누구뇨",
      "source_text_hash": "6844b32b967260b7c1099d4ebf97686ebaff466ef01214542f32c6f5599e7805",
      "translation_text_hash": "085da749afba871b731ca355bfa110a867137ea6a468bac3602ebcd00f91dd67",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
